## Summary
Apple has released new desktop computers specifically designed for local AI development. This update acknowledges the common practice among users of daisy-chaining Macs to enhance AI capabilities.

## Key Points
- Apple's new desktop computers are optimized for local AI development.
- Users have been daisy-chaining Macs to improve AI performance.
- The design refresh responds to user behavior in the AI community.
- This could make AI development more efficient on Apple hardware.


